          "linkId": "npp-body",
          "text": "This practice uses and discloses protected health information for treatment, payment, and health-care operations as described in our Notice of Privacy Practices. You may request a paper copy at any time, restrict certain disclosures, request confidential communications, inspect or amend your record, and file a complaint without retaliation. We may share information with other treating providers, your insurance plan, and people you designate below.",
